    {
      "stepId": "submission-confirmation",
      "title": "Application submitted",
      "elements": [],
      "markdownContent": "A copy of your request has been sent to the email address you gave and to the Environmental Health Department at **{polyclinic}**.\n\n## What happens next\n\nYour application goes to the Environmental Health Department associated with the polyclinic closest to the location of where you will be serving food or drink.\n\nIf you do not already have a licensed food business, an Environmental Health Officer will inspect where the food is being prepared and stored.\n\n**Obtaining your permit:**\n\n- The permit is collected from the polyclinic, and an electronic copy is emailed to you. It is valid for 30 days from the date it is issued.\n- [Mass events]({landingUrl}/business-trade/temporary-restaurants-what-you-need-to-know#what-counts-as-a-mass-event) - your permit is issued at the event, not in advance. An officer checks your set-up, and if compliant, issues the permit at the event, not in advance.\n- Permits are non-transferable - Permits are issued for a specific location and/or event, and may be valid for 30 days from the date of issue.\n\nSubmitting an application does not mean that a temporary restaurant permit has been granted.\n\n## Contact\n\nIf you need help, contact the relevant Environmental Health Service office.\n\n- Branford Taitt Polyclinic - [536-3700](tel:+12465363700), [EHD.BTPC@health.gov.bb](mailto:EHD.BTPC@health.gov.bb)\n- David Thompson Health and Social Services Complex - [536-4453](tel:+12465364453), [DTHSSC.EHD@health.gov.bb](mailto:DTHSSC.EHD@health.gov.bb)\n- Eunice Gibson Polyclinic - [536-4033](tel:+12465364033), [EuniceGibsonEHD@health.gov.bb](mailto:EuniceGibsonEHD@health.gov.bb)\n- Maurice Byer Polyclinic - [536-3214](tel:+12465363214), [MBPC.apps@health.gov.bb](mailto:MBPC.apps@health.gov.bb)\n- Randall Phillips Polyclinic - [536-4338](tel:+12465364338), [RPPC.EHD@health.gov.bb](mailto:RPPC.EHD@health.gov.bb)\n- St. Phillip Polyclinic - [536-1240](tel:+12465361240), [StPhilipEHD@health.gov.bb](mailto:StPhilipEHD@health.gov.bb)\n- Winston Scott Polyclinic - [536-3476](tel:+12465363476), [EHD.WSPC@health.gov.bb](mailto:EHD.WSPC@health.gov.bb)"
    }
